{"Version":2,"ProgramText":"; Music: slow and wistful. Open the file with the TRACKER button to see it.\nTRACK LOAD \"Sound/Tracker/winter_evening.amostrk\"\nTRACK PLAY\n\nSCREEN 640,480\nSCREEN SELECT 0\nPARTICLE 1, 10  ; 1=Snow, 20=Density\nRASTER 0,0,0,0 ; Turn off the background raster so we only see the snow\n\nRepeat\n  WAIT VBL\nUNTIL KEYSTATE(\"Space\")\n\nCLSG 0\nWAIT 500 \n\nPARTICLE 2, 10  ; 2=Rain, 10=Density\n\nRepeat\n  WAIT VBL\nUNTIL KEYSTATE(\"Space\")\n\nCLSG 0\nWAIT 500 \n\nPARTICLE 3, 10  ; 3=Stars, 10=Density\n\nRepeat\n  WAIT VBL\nUNTIL KEYSTATE(\"Space\")\n"}